    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Rainy_Day_Abigail",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The countryside looks more interesting on a day like this, don't you think?",
      "translation": "V takový den vypadá krajina zajímavěji, nemyslíš?",
      "sourceSHA256": "1e8292ebf2b85e7d7d63f374300da5a1c5a3d7966f38654ed330f0cd618aa37a",
      "translationSHA256": "2e64e8365e8df9816fc252fa5356ce815db3a6d42f85412bb5bdab194ebb79aa",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I was just gazing out into the rainswept woods... I swear I saw something darker than black shifting around the trees.$6",
      "translation": "Zrovna jsem hleděla do lesů bičovaných deštěm... Přísahám, že jsem mezi stromy viděla pohybovat se něco temnějšího než samotná tma.$6",
      "sourceSHA256": "aac742bfe54856ec6ce75d2ea511244f6c2fed774d6bf3a089801dc3823d4011",
      "translationSHA256": "41258385709d1ee7b3dc5595ae7bde3f01a95947077e5bc58bd1a34632b58f69",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's a good night to see a ghost...",
      "translation": "Dnešní noc je jako stvořená k zahlédnutí ducha...",
      "sourceSHA256": "9787f627c4be551e2f6a3edbec0ca41ad24fd02b106b851a6eb04203da24e19c",
      "translationSHA256": "2593481770f36d4f96ed575de9539aa702fc00c48ff73891aba8d189dd06eccb",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Can you feel it? There's a stillness in the rain...",
      "translation": "Cítíš to? Déšť v sobě má zvláštní klid...",
      "sourceSHA256": "e808c618f607a7496b8d573b3c20aba8137b71ee51501279a6b5eb192c8c9f06",
      "translationSHA256": "0a494d499308acbc0f649cdb38f3abb4fcce4aaaf9b6e5cea60913c571272592",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "On nights like this, I like to turn the light down low and just listen...$8",
      "translation": "Za takových nocí ráda ztlumím světlo a jen poslouchám...$8",
      "sourceSHA256": "af97ccb6bffb1ad2ebc188c9487d6a37e83b86a0ea62b8637abf583ff845289e",
      "translationSHA256": "c2e17c1c571b87942c094c52a4421ae1268603433b2440b4703252939aa303bd",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
